{
  "_about": "Design tokens for Garuka. Roles, not colours: a rebrand changes VALUES only, never names. Palette from the Garuka brand kit \"Full Circle\" (v1.0, Nov 2026): Jacaranda leads, Night reads, Sunrise is only the dot and the reward moment, Petal and Paper are the grounds, Leaf is success. Sunrise fails as text on light grounds, so it appears only as brand fills and as the scanner focus ring on Night. Merchant colours on the join page, web card and passes are runtime values chosen in the designer, checked live by the same WCAG maths (see components.md, ColorField). Regenerate CSS with: node design/build-tokens.mjs ; check with: python3 contrast.py design/tokens.json",
  "_source": "No original pixels were measured: the original's public demo page was blocked to our browser and store screenshots were not downloaded. Roles and states come from recon.md (screens S01-S35, components table). Scale chosen for a dense dashboard + a thumb-first phone scanner.",
